        "original_id": "a8070218-2e03-5fcd-836a-b66cf933c614",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tyler Bunch, Jerry Nelson, Peter Linz\n- Characters: Herry Monster\n- TV Shows: Person of Interest\n- Video Games: Red Dead Redemption, Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Revolver\n- Companies: Rockstar San Diego, Rockstar Games\n- Topics: Off-Broadway productions, American television appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Tyler Bunch has acted in a few Off-Broadway productions.\n- Tyler Bunch has appeared on American television shows including Person of Interest.\n- Tyler Bunch has appeared in video games including Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Redemption, and Red Dead Revolver.\n- Red Dead Redemption is a Western action-adventure video game.\n- Rockstar San Diego developed Red Dead Redemption, and Rockstar Games published it.\n- Herry Monster is a Sesame Street Muppet.\n- Jerry Nelson performed Herry Monster from 1970 to 2003.\n- Tyler Bunch performed Herry Monster in 2013.\n- Peter Linz has performed Herry Monster since 2017.",
